        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram - Menawarkan Rute (Post a Ride)\n\nautonumber 1\n\nactor \&quot;Driver\&quot; as Driver\nboundary \&quot;UI Tawarkan Rute\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Sistem Rute\&quot; as Sistem\ndatabase \&quot;Database\&quot; as DB\n\nactivate Driver\n\n&#39; FASE 1: PENGECEKAN STATUS VERIFIKASI DRIVER\nDriver -&gt; UI : Pilih Menu \&quot;Tawarkan Rute\&quot; ()\nactivate UI\n\nUI -&gt; Sistem : Cek Status Verifikasi Driver (driver_id)\nactivate Sistem\n\nSistem -&gt; DB : Query Status Verifikasi SIM &amp; STNK ()\nactivate DB\n\nDB --&gt; Sistem : Return Status Verifikasi ()\ndeactivate DB\n\nalt Status == Belum Terverifikasi\n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Return Status Belum Diverifikasi ()\n    UI --&gt; Driver : Tampilkan Pesan \&quot;Verifikasi SIM &amp; STNK Terlebih Dahulu\&quot;\nelse Status == Verified / Aktif\n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Tampilkan Form Tawarkan Rute ()\nend\n\ndeactivate Sistem\ndeactivate UI\n\n&#39; FASE 2: PENGISIAN &amp; VALIDASI FORM RUTE\nDriver -&gt; UI : Input Detail Rute (Asal, Tujuan, Waktu, Kapasitas)\nactivate UI\n\nDriver -&gt; UI : Klik \&quot;Publikasikan Rute\&quot; ()\n\nUI -&gt; Sistem : Submit Data Rute (routeData)\nactivate Sistem\n\nSistem -&gt; Sistem : Validasi Kelengkapan &amp; Format Data Rute ()\n\nalt Data Form Tidak Lengkap / Invalid\n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Return Status \&quot;Form / Kapasitas Kursi Tidak Valid\&quot;\n    UI --&gt; Driver : Tampilkan Pesan \&quot;Lengkapi Seluruh Kolom Rute\&quot;\nelse Data Form Lengkap &amp; Valid\n    &#39; FASE 3: PENYIMPANAN &amp; NOTIFIKASI\n    Sistem -&gt; Sistem : Kalkulasi Estimasi Biaya Operasional ()\n    Sistem -&gt; DB : Simpan Data Rute Baru (driver_id, rute_data) ()\n    activate DB\n    \n    DB --&gt; Sistem : Konfirmasi Data Tersimpan (rute_id) ()\n    deactivate DB\n    \n    Sistem -&gt; Sistem : Update Ketersediaan di Matching Pool ()\n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Return Status \&quot;Rute Berhasil Dipublikasikan\&quot; ()\n    UI --&gt; Driver : Tampilkan Notifikasi Sukses &amp; Halaman Rute Aktif ()\nend\n\ndeactivate Sistem\ndeactivate UI\ndeactivate Driver\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="eV5QnKnWENGLETObmGjk-48">
