        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram - Membatalkan Pesanan (Cancel Order)\n\nautonumber 1\n\nactor \&quot;Pemohon\&quot; as Pemohon\nboundary \&quot;UI Pesanan\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Sistem Pesanan\&quot; as Sistem\ndatabase \&quot;Database\&quot; as DB\nboundary \&quot;UI Pihak Terdampak\&quot; as TerdampakUI\n\nactivate Pemohon\n\n&#39; FASE 1: INISIASI &amp; PENGECEKAN STATUS\nPemohon -&gt; UI : Buka Detail Pesanan Aktif ()\nactivate UI\n\nPemohon -&gt; UI : Klik \&quot;Batalkan Pesanan\&quot; ()\nUI -&gt; Sistem : Cek Status Pesanan Terkini (order_id)\nactivate Sistem\n\nSistem -&gt; DB : Query Status Order (order_id)\nactivate DB\n\nDB --&gt; Sistem : Return Status Order ()\ndeactivate DB\n\nalt Status == Perjalanan Berlangsung / Selesai\n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Return Status \&quot;Tidak Dapat Dibatalkan\&quot; ()\n    UI --&gt; Pemohon : Tampilkan Pesan \&quot;Perjalanan sedang berlangsung atau telah selesai\&quot;\nelse Status == Pending / Menunggu Penjemputan\n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Tampilkan Dialog Input Alasan Pembatalan ()\n    deactivate Sistem\n    deactivate UI\n    \n    &#39; FASE 2: INPUT ALASAN &amp; EVALUASI PENALTI\n    Pemohon -&gt; UI : Pilih / Isi Alasan &amp; Klik \&quot;Konfirmasi Pembatalan\&quot; ()\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; Sistem : Submit Pembatalan (order_id, alasan)\n    activate Sistem\n    \n    Sistem -&gt; Sistem : Evaluasi Aturan Penalti Pembatalan Sepihak ()\n    \n    alt Terkena Penalti (Batas Waktu Terlewati)\n        Sistem -&gt; DB : Catat Pengurangan Skor Rating / Penalti Akun ()\n        activate DB\n        DB --&gt; Sistem : Konfirmasi Penalti Dicatat ()\n        deactivate DB\n    end\n    \n    &#39; FASE 3: PEMBARUAN DATA &amp; NOTIFIKASI\n    Sistem -&gt; DB : Update Status Order = \&quot;Cancelled\&quot; ()\n    activate DB\n    Sistem -&gt; DB : Restore Kuota Kursi (+1) pada Rute Terkait ()\n    DB --&gt; Sistem : Konfirmasi Data Berhasil Diperbarui ()\n    deactivate DB\n    \n    Sistem --&gt; UI : Return Status \&quot;Pembatalan Berhasil\&quot; ()\n    UI --&gt; Pemohon : Tampilkan Pesan \&quot;Pesanan Berhasil Dibatalkan\&quot; ()\n    \n    Sistem -&gt; TerdampakUI : Kirim Push Notification Pembatalan ()\n    activate TerdampakUI\n    TerdampakUI -&gt; TerdampakUI : Update Tampilan Status Pesanan ()\n    deactivate TerdampakUI\nend\n\ndeactivate Sistem\ndeactivate UI\ndeactivate Driver\ndeactivate Pemohon\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="3XGJSoNSGoGooSd2e1qG-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
